OL,3,GNEWSABlack History Month decision 'dog
OL,4,Awhistle politics', says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region's mayor Steve
OL,7,FRotheram has described a decision by a
OL,8,FMerseyside council to withdraw support
OL,9,Ffor Black History Month as "the worst
OL,10,Fdog whistle politics".
OL,12,FThe period is marked every October and
OL,13,Fcelebrates the achievements, history
OL,14,Fand contributions of black people
OL,15,Facross the UK.
OL,17,FHowever, St Helens Council's Reform
OL,18,Fleader George Woodward told the BBC
OL,19,Flast week he believed the event was
OL,20,F"racist" and "divisive".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
