OL,3,GNEWSABlack History Month decision 'dog
OL,4,Awhistle politics', says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FCriticising the decision, Rotheram
OL,7,Fsaid: "I think it's the worst dog
OL,8,Fwhistle politics I desperately try to
OL,9,Favoid. He says things about British as
OL,10,Fif we're talking about black people and
OL,11,FBritishness being separate."
